    "name": "request_secret",
    "description": "Ask the user for a secret (API key, token, password) without it ever entering the conversation. The user pastes it into a masked box and the mod saves it to the project .env. You get back the variable name and a placeholder like [REDACTED-SECRET-1a2b3c4d]. Write that placeholder in a command or file and it becomes the real value when the tool runs. Use this INSTEAD of asking the user to paste a secret into chat."
